nurbs_ex10: not implemented in fem-rs — refusing to print numbers that
cannot be checked against MFEM 4.10. Missing:
  * vector NURBS H1 space (FiniteElementSpace(mesh, NURBSext, fec, vdim=dim))
    with per-component essential DOFs (crates/space/src/nurbs_fe_space.rs)
  * VectorMassIntegrator / VectorDiffusionIntegrator on NURBS elements
    (crates/assembly)
  * HyperelasticNLFIntegrator on NURBS elements: Mult / GetGradient /
    GetEnergy with NeoHookeanModel (crates/assembly/src/physics)
  * vector ELEMENTL2 projection (ProjectCoefficient) for initial conditions
  * elastic energy density projection (GetElasticEnergyDensity)
The scalar/H1 reference port is examples/mfem_ex10_hyperelastic_dyn.rs; the
NURBS patch-aware assembly groundwork is crates/assembly/src/iga/nurbs_patch.rs.
